@TicketReservationApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5133
@eventId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### List events
GET {{TicketReservationApi_HostAddress}}/api/events
Accept: application/json

### Get event
GET {{TicketReservationApi_HostAddress}}/api/events/{{eventId}}
Accept: application/json

### Create event
POST {{TicketReservationApi_HostAddress}}/api/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Konser",
  "description": "Açık hava konseri",
  "venue": "Salon A",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-31T20:00:00Z",
  "capacity": 100
}

### Update event
PUT {{TicketReservationApi_HostAddress}}/api/events/{{eventId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Konser",
  "description": "Açık hava konseri",
  "venue": "Salon B",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-31T21:00:00Z",
  "capacity": 120
}

### Cancel event
PATCH {{TicketReservationApi_HostAddress}}/api/events/{{eventId}}/cancel

###
